  "intro": ["December 1st, 1999.", "You step off the train at Nagiura. The air smells of salt and snow.", "This town has an old legend.", "Never hear the New Year's Eve whistle alone.", "Whoever hears it alone will live the same December again.", {"text": "...Everyone in town knows that much.", "nometa": "m_dejavu"}, {"text": "You feel you have seen this morning before.", "meta": "m_dejavu"}, {"text": "You remember it, down to the sound of the alarm clock.", "meta": "m_calendars"}, {"text": "You remember it, down to the number of sugar cubes.", "meta": "m_itsumono"}, "> Connected to NAGI-NET."],
