  "help": ["[How December Works]", "- You spend December 1st to 31st, across five chapters.", "  Each scene, you choose one place to go. Each scene costs 1 Energy.", "- The words on a door never lie. Each person's sign is always the same.", "- When your Energy runs out, every door becomes \"???\".", "  Too tired to know whose errand is whose. Sleep or coffee restores it.", "- Each scene costs 1 Meal. With Meals at 0, you lose 2 Health a scene.", "- You can carry 8 items. Key items don't count.", "- Affection (hearts) decides your New Year's Eve. Some feelings are hidden.", "- Keep your promises. A broken promise leaves a wound.", "- In a small town, being alone together in public starts rumors.", "- A check succeeds if two dice plus your stat meet the target.", "  If you fail, spend 1 Luck to reroll. Red checks can't be rerolled.", "- At 0 Composure you get shaken, and say things you never meant.", "- At 0 Health, you spend the year's end in bed.", "- On NAGI-NET you can search words you have seen or heard in town.", "  It means staying up late, so it costs 1 Energy.", "- A BAD END sends you back to the morning of December 1st.", "  All you can carry over is déjà vu.", "- If you hear the New Year's Eve whistle alone--"],
